# Node / web
**/node_modules/
**/.package-lock.json
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Builds / caches (adjust if you use these)
# NOTE: the repo-root dist/ holds GENERATED ontology release artifacts that are
# intentionally tracked (downstream consumers + CI read them).
build/
.cache/
.next/
coverage/

# Python virtualenv
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# WIDOCO documentation: generated HTML site + cached tool jar (published via CI)
docs/widoco/
tooling/.widoco/

# Local LaTeX builds of the manuscript (never packaged or committed)
docs/paper/overleaf/**/.latex-build/
docs/paper/overleaf/main.pdf
docs/paper/overleaf/**/*.aux
docs/paper/overleaf/**/*.log
docs/paper/overleaf/**/*.out
docs/paper/overleaf/**/*.upa
docs/paper/overleaf/**/*.upb
docs/paper/overleaf/**/*.bbl
docs/paper/overleaf/**/*.blg
docs/paper/overleaf/**/*.synctex.gz
